            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A Digital Sales Room (DSR) is a personalized, secure online hub created for a specific buyer or account. It centralizes all sales-related content, communication, and collaboration in one branded space. This replaces fragmented email threads and generic file shares with a structured, interactive experience designed to guide the buying committee."
